    <summary>App launcher and scheduler: pin apps, scripts, folders and URLs into groups and run them on a schedule.</summary>
    <description>FlowDesk is a unified task launcher and scheduler. Pin apps, scripts, folders, and URLs, organise them into categories, and schedule anything to run at a time or interval — with optional UAC elevation. Import and export your setup as JSON. Everything in one tight interface, nothing in the system tray you didn't ask for.

## Features
- **App launcher** - Pin apps, scripts, folders, and URLs for one-click launch. Search through everything instantly as your list grows.
- **Scheduler** - Schedule any item to run at a specific time, on an interval, or at startup. Set it once and forget it.
- **UAC elevation** - Run any launcher item as administrator with built-in elevation support.
- **Categories** - Organise launchers into labelled groups. Collapse, reorder, and customise to match how you actually work.
- **Import / Export** - Save your entire launcher setup to a JSON file. Restore it on a new machine or share it with your team.
- **App search** - Search installed apps directly from FlowDesk without opening the Start menu or typing in Explorer.

## Notes
- Free for personal use. Business or commercial use requires a paid license (see https://tapatch.com/terms/).
- Windows 10/11, 64-bit. Runs fully locally; no ads, no telemetry, no bundled offers.
- Available in 10 languages: English, Chinese (Simplified), Russian, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Japanese, French, Polish and Korean.
- The Terms of Service are shown on first launch and must be accepted to use the app.
</description>
    <releaseNotes>- Now in 10 languages: English, Chinese (Simplified), Russian, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Japanese, French, Polish and Korean
